{"seq":2,"slug":"mhc-antigen-presentation","title":"MHC 与抗原呈递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/mhc-antigen-presentation","wordCount":1640,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"mhc-与抗原呈递\">MHC 与抗原呈递</h1><p><a href=\"antibody-structure\">抗体</a>能识别病原的天然三维结构，但 T 细胞不能——T 细胞受体根本「看不见」完整的蛋白质，它只能识别被切碎、装载到 MHC 分子凹槽里、并展示在细胞表面的肽段。这个限制叫 MHC 限制性，是免疫学最深刻也最反直觉的设计：它让 T 细胞得以「透视」细胞内部正在发生什么，从而发现藏在细胞里的病毒和癌变。MHC 与抗原呈递是连接<a href=\"../overview/innate-immunity\">先天免疫</a>的吞噬呈递与<a href=\"../immune-response/cellular-memory\">细胞免疫</a>执行的中枢枢纽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>主要组织相容性复合体（MHC，major histocompatibility complex；人类称 HLA）是一组高度多态的细胞表面分子，作用是把细胞内蛋白降解产生的肽段「展示」给 T 细胞检阅。MHC 分两类，对应两条完全不同的抗原来源通路，识别它们的也是两类不同的 T 细胞。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[蛋白来源] --&gt; B[内源性蛋白&lt;br/&gt;病毒/自身]&#10;    A --&gt; C[外源性蛋白&lt;br/&gt;吞噬摄入]&#10;    B --&gt; D[蛋白酶体降解]&#10;    D --&gt; E[TAP 转运至内质网]&#10;    E --&gt; F[装载 MHC I]&#10;    F --&gt; G[呈递给 CD8+ T 细胞&lt;br/&gt;所有有核细胞]&#10;    C --&gt; H[内体/溶酶体降解]&#10;    H --&gt; I[装载 MHC II]&#10;    I --&gt; J[呈递给 CD4+ T 细胞&lt;br/&gt;仅专职 APC]\">flowchart TD\n    A[蛋白来源] --&gt; B[内源性蛋白&lt;br/&gt;病毒/自身]\n    A --&gt; C[外源性蛋白&lt;br/&gt;吞噬摄入]\n    B --&gt; D[蛋白酶体降解]\n    D --&gt; E[TAP 转运至内质网]\n    E --&gt; F[装载 MHC I]\n    F --&gt; G[呈递给 CD8+ T 细胞&lt;br/&gt;所有有核细胞]\n    C --&gt; H[内体/溶酶体降解]\n    H --&gt; I[装载 MHC II]\n    I --&gt; J[呈递给 CD4+ T 细胞&lt;br/&gt;仅专职 APC]</pre><p>「内源走 MHC I 给 CD8、外源走 MHC II 给 CD4」是理解全部抗原呈递的总纲，下表把它结构化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MHC I 类</th>\n<th>MHC II 类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表达细胞</td>\n<td>所有有核细胞</td>\n<td>专职 APC（DC、巨噬细胞、B 细胞）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗原来源</td>\n<td>内源性（胞质蛋白）</td>\n<td>外源性（吞噬摄入）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加工场所</td>\n<td>蛋白酶体→内质网</td>\n<td>内体/溶酶体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肽长度</td>\n<td>约 8–10 个氨基酸</td>\n<td>约 13–25 个氨基酸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>识别的 T 细胞</td>\n<td>CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（细胞毒性）</td>\n<td>CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（辅助性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生物学意义</td>\n<td>报告「细胞内有什么」</td>\n<td>报告「细胞外吞了什么」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mhc-i-类-报告细胞内部状态\">MHC I 类：报告细胞内部状态</h2><p>每个有核细胞都在不断把自身合成的蛋白质降解、取样、展示在 MHC I 上——相当于持续向免疫系统「直播」自己内部正在生产什么。健康细胞展示的都是正常自身肽，CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞略过不理；一旦细胞被病毒感染或发生癌变，异常蛋白（病毒蛋白、突变蛋白）也会被加工展示，巡逻的 CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞便识别并清除该细胞。</p>\n<p>这条通路的分子机制环环相扣：胞质中的蛋白酶体（proteasome）把蛋白切成短肽，TAP 转运蛋白把肽泵入内质网，肽在那里装载到新合成的 MHC I 分子凹槽中，复合物再经高尔基体运到细胞表面。许多病毒为逃避监视会破坏这条通路——例如下调 MHC I 表达。但这恰恰触发了<a href=\"../overview/innate-immunity\">先天免疫</a>中 NK 细胞的「缺失的自我」杀伤，形成精巧的双保险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mhc-ii-类-报告细胞外部威胁\">MHC II 类：报告细胞外部威胁</h2><p>MHC II 只表达在专职抗原呈递细胞（APC）上，呈递的是细胞从外部吞入的抗原。树突状细胞、巨噬细胞、B 细胞吞噬细菌或摄取外源蛋白后，在内体/溶酶体中将其降解成肽，装载到 MHC II 上，展示给 CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 辅助 T 细胞。</p>\n<p>CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞被激活后不直接杀伤，而是充当「指挥中枢」：分泌细胞因子帮助 B 细胞产生抗体（驱动<a href=\"../immune-response/humoral-response\">体液免疫应答</a>）、增强巨噬细胞杀菌、并辅助 CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞应答。值得注意的是，初始 CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞要被有效激活，光有 MHC II-肽（信号一）不够，还需 APC 提供共刺激信号（如 B7-CD28，信号二）——缺了信号二，T 细胞反而失能，这是外周耐受的重要机制，详见<a href=\"../health-disease/allergy-autoimmunity\">过敏与自身免疫</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交叉呈递-打通两条通路\">交叉呈递：打通两条通路</h2><p>按上述规则，外源抗原只走 MHC II 给 CD4，那么针对一个细胞外病毒或一个不感染 DC 的肿瘤，CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞如何被启动？答案是交叉呈递（cross-presentation）：某些树突状细胞（尤其是 cDC1 亚群）能把吞入的外源抗原破例装载到 MHC I 上，从而激活 CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞。</p>\n<p>交叉呈递在抗病毒和抗肿瘤免疫中至关重要——它是免疫系统启动细胞毒性应答去对付那些不直接感染 APC 的目标的唯一途径。这一机制也是许多<a href=\"../health-disease/tumor-immunotherapy\">肿瘤免疫与免疫疗法</a>策略（如某些癌症疫苗与佐剂设计）试图增强的关键环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多态性与移植-关联疾病\">多态性与移植、关联疾病</h2><p>MHC 是人类基因组中多态性最高的区域之一，HLA 基因有成千上万个等位基因。这种极端多样性是群体层面的免疫策略：不同个体的 MHC 能呈递不同的肽段谱，使整个人群对任一病原都不至于「全军覆没」。可粗略地理解，一个个体能呈递的肽集合大小正比于其 MHC 等位基因的多样性。</p>\n<p>但 MHC 多态性也带来代价。器官移植时，受者 T 细胞会把供者的异型 MHC 当作外来抗原猛烈攻击，导致排斥——「组织相容性」之名正源于此，临床因此要做 HLA 配型并用免疫抑制剂。此外，许多自身免疫病与特定 HLA 型强相关（如强直性脊柱炎与 HLA-B27），因为某些 MHC 等位基因更容易呈递自身肽或选择出自反应 T 细胞，这条线索延伸至<a href=\"../health-disease/allergy-autoimmunity\">过敏与自身免疫</a>。</p>\n<p>最后值得点出 MHC 在抗原呈递之外的临床应用价值。由于每个人的 MHC 型别近乎独一无二，HLA 配型不仅用于移植，也用于法医个体识别和疾病风险预测；新一代癌症免疫疗法更要先预测患者 MHC 能呈递哪些肿瘤新抗原，再据此设计<a href=\"../health-disease/vaccine-principles\">疫苗</a>——这套「新抗原预测」算法的核心，正是计算某段突变肽与患者特定 MHC 等位基因的结合亲和力。可见抗原呈递不只是一个生物学概念，更是连接基础免疫学与精准医学的关键接口，也是理解<a href=\"../health-disease/tumor-immunotherapy\">肿瘤免疫与免疫疗法</a>中个性化策略的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>T 细胞只能识别被 MHC 分子加工呈递的肽段，此即 MHC 限制性，让 T 细胞得以「透视」细胞内部。</li>\n<li>MHC I 表达于所有有核细胞，呈递内源肽给 CD8<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞，报告细胞内部状态。</li>\n<li>MHC II 仅表达于专职 APC，呈递外源肽给 CD4<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> T 细胞；CD4 激活还需共刺激信号二。</li>\n<li>交叉呈递让 DC 将外源抗原破例装上 MHC I，是启动抗病毒/抗肿瘤 CD8 应答的关键。</li>\n<li>MHC 极端多态是群体免疫策略，但导致移植排斥并与多种自身免疫病强关联。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MHC 与抗原呈递","id":"mhc-与抗原呈递"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MHC I 类：报告细胞内部状态","id":"mhc-i-类-报告细胞内部状态"},{"level":2,"text":"MHC II 类：报告细胞外部威胁","id":"mhc-ii-类-报告细胞外部威胁"},{"level":2,"text":"交叉呈递：打通两条通路","id":"交叉呈递-打通两条通路"},{"level":2,"text":"多态性与移植、关联疾病","id":"多态性与移植-关联疾病"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"抗体结构与功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/antibody-structure"},"next":{"title":"T 与 B 细胞受体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/immunology-fundamentals/molecular-recognition/lymphocyte-receptors"}}